.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ngx-show 1  "ngx-show " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-show \- Show everything about one site: SSL, routing, backend process, locations, logs, traffic
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-show\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISITE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show everything about one site: SSL, routing, backend process, locations, logs, traffic
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print JSON instead of the detail view
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISITE\fR>
Site ID (from `ngx ls`) or any of its domain names
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  ngx show 4
  ngx show blog.example.com
  ngx show 4 \-\-json
